🎯 What Is Prior Authorization?
Before a doctor can perform surgery, prescribe a specialty drug, or admit a patient to a hospital — the insurance company must pre-approve it. This is called Prior Authorization (PA). It's one of the most common sources of treatment delays in the US healthcare system:
94% of physicians say PA causes treatment delays
Providers spend 16+ hours per week on PA paperwork
Many patients abandon treatment after a denial
This simulator lets you experience the full PA workflow interactively.
