🎮 How to Play
Open the file in your browser
Read the patient info on the right panel
Click the Current Actions buttons in sequence
Collect all documents before you can submit
Advance through Review → Decision
Approve, Pend, or Deny — then handle the outcome
Click New Patient to try the next scenario
Scoring tip: Avoid denials and pends. Complete document collection efficiently. Faster = higher efficiency score.
